sequenceDiagram
    participant B as Benchmark
    participant W as Inference Workers
    participant M as Metrics Actor

    Note over B,W: 1. Scatter-gather
    B->>W: infer (to all shards)
    W-->>B: results + latency

    Note over B,W: 2. Elastic pool
    B->>W: checkout, infer, checkin
    W-->>B: result

    Note over B,W: 3. Collectives
    B->>W: broadcast, barrier, reduce
    W-->>B: aggregated stats

    W--)M: inference_completed (fire-and-forget)
    B->>B: report throughput, latency, efficiency
